@startuml
title L2-026 - Find inspiration by meaning
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Library owner" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application / domain / api" #E0F2FE
participant "MeaningSearchResults" as page
participant "SearchService" as client
end box
box "Backend - Loupe API application" #D1FADF
participant "SearchController" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "MeaningSearchQueryHandler" as handler
participant "SemanticCursor" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
database "Library store" as db
participant "IEmbeddingProvider / IVectorSearchReader adapters" as ext
end box
actor -> page : Find inspiration by meaning
page -> client : nonblank query, filters, cursor?, pageSize?
client -> controller : GET /api/search?mode=meaning
note over controller : API middleware authenticates; controller binds only
controller -> handler : MediatR dispatch MeaningSearchQuery
handler -> db : Load / validate owner-scoped state before side effects
db --> handler : Owned state or unavailable result
handler -> db : Load active generation and validate cursor [L2-026]
db --> handler : Coherent model identity or refresh-required 409
handler -> ext : Embed nonblank query using active generation model
ext --> handler : Compatible query vector or service failure
alt embedding or similarity unavailable
handler --> controller : Meaning unavailable; offer explicit Keyword switch
else live compatible vectors
handler -> ext : Filter current owned candidates; cosine >= 0.20; then page
ext --> handler : Score descending / ID ascending + generation cursor
end
handler --> controller : 200 labeled live results; no silent keyword/demo substitution
controller --> client : Typed HTTP response / ProblemDetails
client --> page : Update state signals
page --> actor : Saved / loaded state or retained-input error
@enduml
